        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 text-base text-vulcan-300 ">
          <li>
              <div class="relative flex items-center py-2">
                <p class="ml-2 text-base leading-6 text-vulcan-300">Build a referral program that turns customer advocacy to revenue driver through SMS, Emails, Social media and more.
                </p>
              </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="h-full">
        <img
          alt="Lexington thumbnail"
          class="rounded-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50 w-full"
