            Powerful Coupon Generator
        </p>
         <ul class="mt-4 text-base text-vulcan-300 ">
          <li>
              <div class="relative flex items-center py-2">
                <p class="ml-2 text-base leading-6 text-vulcan-300">Bulk, Dynamic & Personalize coupons generation for your Store.
                </p>
              </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="h-full">
        <img
          alt="Lexington thumbnail"
          class="rounded-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50 w-full"
          src="https://nine9minds-staging.onrender.com/static/coupon-generator-d0aadd2bf9056625a344c4c7b03552c1.png"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 mt-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24 items-center">
      <div class="sm:order-last  ">
        <p class="text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
            Seamless POS Integration
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 text-base text-vulcan-300 ">
          <li>
              <div class="relative flex items-center py-2">
